<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Freeport-McMoRan EPS raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Freeport-McMoRan EPS raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>--EVEREN Securities Inc said Monday it raised its EPS estimates on Freeport-McMoRan Copper &amp; Gold Inc to $0.41 from $0.25 for Q4 and to $0.91 from $0.76 for full-year 1996.  </p>
<p>--EVEREN said it believes reserves additions this year will be substantial and possibly of higher grade.</p>
<p>--It reiterated its intermediate six-month price target of $34 on the stock.</p>
<p>--Freeport-McMoRan was trading at 31-3/4, off 1/8.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
